[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4524992354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119676#issuecomment-4524992354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119676","id":4524992354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDbXnYg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-23T09:52:09Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T09:52:09Z","body":"I'm not sure it's good to add fragility to the code and potential pitfalls for future code utilizing SSE4.2 in the main codebase, and potential for lingering undiscovered bugs in those code paths due to no CI catching variations making the configuration unusable anyway, by enabling disabling SSE4.2\r\n\r\nI think a good reference for the actual market share for devices that would benefit from this would be good, seeing how the feature has been standard for about 15 years, and how likely any such hardware is to be able to run Godot 4.x in the first place\r\n\r\nIt being opt-in means that very few if any developers will use it in the first place, so I feel that it'll have a very tiny surface for testing, making it very easy for bugs to creep in\r\n\r\nBeing able to opt-in for higher end features would be good though, it has a more clearly defined benefit IMO, and is probably far easier to test on hardware, and gives us an upgrade path as AVX becomes more universal","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4524992354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4525001204","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119676#issuecomment-4525001204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119676","id":4525001204,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDbYJ9A","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-23T09:57:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T09:57:19Z","body":"Practically it will likely only require a few flags/ selection of specific files for third party libs, so I would not expect any significant maintenance costs. And we need to support ARM64 in any case, so there can't be any SSE4.2 only code regardless of this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4525001204/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4525018477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119676#issuecomment-4525018477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119676","id":4525018477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDbZNbQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-23T10:06:24Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T10:06:24Z","body":"We could have point optimizations using SSE4.2 with conditionals but fair point\r\n\r\nNote that for Windows the need is going to become marginal as Windows 10 users dwindle with it being EOL","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4525018477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4525037456","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119676#issuecomment-4525037456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119676","id":4525037456,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDbaXkA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-23T10:16:44Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T10:16:44Z","body":"> We could have point optimizations using SSE4.2 with conditionals but fair point\n\nAll AVX+ systems should also support SSE4.2, so if we add some SSE4.2 optimizations it should be usable as is in builds targeting newer ISA.\n\nAnd I would expect full support for Windows 10 to remain until at least 2032 (end of extended support for enterprise and schools).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4525037456/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]